17,18 $ Pore surface white to cream  -
18,0 $ Pores averaging about 2 to 3 per mm; mostly found on hardwoods but also on juniper  - $ Antrodia albida
18,0 $ Pores averaging about 1 to 2 per mm; on dead standing conifers, rarely on hardwoods  - $ Antrodia heteromorpha
19,20 $ Upper surface of basidiomata glabrous, zonate or not  -
